士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x840E35FF8B3E0B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120202011:1":{"text":"……でも、それとオレたちになんの関係が？","source_cn":"……但这和我们又有什么关系？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4029007E0510CC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120202012:1":{"text":"ソーン、アルサ、お前たちは今回の戦歌祭の勝者だ。","source_cn":"索恩，阿尔萨，你们是这次战歌节的胜者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9619A55457F8092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120202013:1":{"text":"表向きに言えば、ブラックロアーはお前たちのような強者と良好な関係を保っていたいんだ。お前たちを味方につけられれば言うことない。","source_cn":"于公而言，黑嚎希望能和像你们这样的强者维持好关系，若是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C9016E744B8E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120202014:1":{"text":"個人的には……お前たちは兄貴の最期を目の当たりにした。兄貴がカタストロフに操られてひどく苦しんでた時に、救ってくれたのはお前たちだ。","source_cn":"于私而言……你们见证了奥格的终局。在他被恶魔操控而痛苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33726DE76067D715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120202015:1":{"text":"オレは救ったと思ってないけど。","source_cn":"我不认为那叫拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEFE08CA518C44D","