_cn":"索恩，我并不是因为你与黑嚎……与奥格的关系，才来邀请你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F31AB55A41A868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120202024:1":{"text":"俺はお前を純然たる強者だと思ってる。お前の体に流れる血筋とも無関係だ。俺にとって、お前はウール族のソーンだ。","source_cn":"我将你视作一位纯粹的强者，与你身体里所流淌的血液无关，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C4385819D51A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120202025:1":{"text":"知っての通り、ブラックロアーは力を崇めている。真の強者には敬意を払うのみだ。","source_cn":"你知道的，黑嚎推崇力量。面对真正的强者，只会尊敬万分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53A9DBA88A67D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120202026:1":{"text":"彼、すごく誠実そうだけど……ソーンはどう思う？","source_cn":"他好像还挺真诚的……索恩，你觉得呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63689E5FA8426CA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1120202026":{"text":"彼、すごく誠実そうだけど……ソーンはどう思う？","source_cn":"他好像还挺真诚的……索恩，你觉得呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63689E5FA8426CA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120202027:2":{"text":"……分かったよ、葬式に参加する。だけど、それだけだからな。","source_cn":"……好。我会参加葬礼。但是，也就仅此而已了。","status":"matched","ha